.TH batten-bench-tokens 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-bench\-tokens \- Measure the token economics of the Batten\-wrapped path against the raw tool, from committed fixtures
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten bench tokens\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure the token economics of the Batten\-wrapped path against the raw tool, from committed fixtures
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Diff a fresh run against the committed table instead of writing it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
